{
  "an4.105:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.105 ",
  "an4.105:0.2": "11. Valāhakavagga ",
  "an4.105:0.3": "Ambasutta ",
  "an4.105:1.1": "“Cattārimāni, bhikkhave, ambāni. ",
  "an4.105:1.2": "Katamāni cattāri? ",
  "an4.105:1.3": "Āmaṁ pakkavaṇṇi, ",
  "an4.105:1.4": "pakkaṁ āmavaṇṇi, ",
  "an4.105:1.5": "āmaṁ āmavaṇṇi, ",
  "an4.105:1.6": "pakkaṁ pakkavaṇṇi—",
  "an4.105:1.7": "Imāni kho, bhikkhave, cattāri ambāni. ",
  "an4.105:1.8": "Evamevaṁ kho, bhikkhave, cattāro ambūpamā puggalā santo saṁvijjamānā lokasmiṁ. ",
  "an4.105:1.9": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "an4.105:1.10": "Āmo pakkavaṇṇī, ",
  "an4.105:1.11": "pakko āmavaṇṇī, ",
  "an4.105:1.12": "āmo āmavaṇṇī, ",
  "an4.105:1.13": "pakko pakkavaṇṇī. ",
  "an4.105:2.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, puggalo āmo hoti pakkavaṇṇī? ",
  "an4.105:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekaccassa puggalassa pāsādikaṁ hoti abhikkantaṁ paṭikkantaṁ ālokitaṁ vilokitaṁ samiñjitaṁ pasāritaṁ saṅghāṭipattacīvaradhāraṇaṁ. ",
  "an4.105:2.3": "So ‘idaṁ dukkhan’ti yathābhūtaṁ nappajānāti …pe… ‘ayaṁ dukkhanirodhagāminī paṭipadā’ti yathābhūtaṁ nappajānāti. ",
  "an4.105:2.4": "Evaṁ kho, bhikkhave, puggalo āmo hoti pakkavaṇṇī. ",
  "an4.105:2.5": "Seyyathāpi taṁ, bhikkhave, ambaṁ āmaṁ pakkavaṇṇi; ",
  "an4.105:2.6": "tathūpamāhaṁ, bhikkhave, imaṁ puggalaṁ vadāmi. ",
  "an4.105:3.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, puggalo pakko hoti āmava